    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p><strong>Distraction:</strong> Made up of firecrackers and noise makers, these grenades are used to lure and distract enemies.</p><p><strong>Smoke:</strong> Used to blind and surprise unaware foes, anyone caught in the radius of this grenade is Surprised and must roll a Challenging (+0) Initiative Test or gain 1 Blind Condition.</p><p><strong>Stun:</strong> Used to incapacitate foes, anyone caught in the radius of this grenade must roll a Challenging (+0) Endurance Test or gain 1 Stun condition per -SL on their roll.</p><p><strong>Poison:</strong> Used to weaken and kill targets, anyone caught in the radius of this grenade must roll a Challenging (+0) Endurance Test or gain 1 Poison condition plus 1 per -SL on their roll.</p>"
    },
